# print: a file to the printer on LPT1, every byte of it. (DOSBox-X has no
# fixed disk; tests/storage/printers.test runs its printers.)
program: shell
keys: print c:\\docs\\printme.txt\n
emulators: bochs
lpt1: rx286 printer test page
lpt1: -----------------------
lpt1: The kernel sent each of these bytes to the printer port,
lpt1: polling the printer's BUSY line, one strobe a byte.
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>print c:\docs\printme.txt
printed 161 bytes on LPT1
A:\>
